# Python bytecode — direct cause of SHA drift on claude/vscode-ext-patchs/.
# Without this exclusion, COPY claude/vscode-ext-patchs/ embarks the local
# .pyc into the layer → different SHA across machines/projects → derived
# images orphaned at next base rebuild.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo

# Security — never in an image
.env
.env.*

# Local logs
*.log
logs/
